      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The issue here is not all YouTube videos, but all of the YouTube videos that have copyrighted content on them. This is why worlds like karaoke are completely broken. It's why when you're trying to play a music video to listen to music, it's broken. If you find some random video that doesn't have anything copyrighted in it, it will play. \nIt's going to be close to 2 weeks since this bug was introduced in the build 920 patch, which ironically enough mentioned in the patch notes that they have fixed things with SyncVideoPlayer and SyncVideoStream. So yeah, it's broken even more now since they \"fixed\" it. \nSo many videos can't be played, so many worlds that rely on videos are completely broken. Please fix this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
